# A check line's pattern names a case by its qualified name (`Sizes.Large`), as an
# expression would (Semantics ch. 2, "Qualified names and families"; Conformance ch. 1,
# "Checks"): the case's module path is part of the name, and the value printed bare
# (`Large`) matches it. Gap QP: the Test Worlds compared the pattern's whole spelling with
# the bare case name.
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Sizes
test mod Tests
use Ui

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{Show (Sizes.Of 3)}")
